--
std::common_reference_with of a type with itself, with the headers of
libstdc++ 16 (tagged libstdcxx16: runs only where the host gcc is 16 or
later, regression/README.md).  With those headers "static assertion
failed: same reference type" dropped main until is_same on reference
kinds and compound requirements were fixed.  The cv-differing case,
common_reference_with<W &, const W &>, is
cpp20_common_reference_with_cv_differing_references.  To check elsewhere,
preprocess with g++-16 -E and run cbmc on the .ii file.
